  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anti-corruption UNODC Myanmar 2017-2020</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anti-korruption UNODC Myanmar 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNODC:s program som syftar till att relevanta myndigheter, akt&#xf6;rer inom civilsamh&#xe4;lle och privat n&#xe4;ringsliv i Myanmar med &#xf6;kad effektivitet f&#xf6;rhindrar, &#xf6;kar medvetenheten om, uppt&#xe4;cker, utreder och &#xe5;talar korruption.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for UNODC&apos;s programs aimed at relevant authorities in Myanmar to more effectively prevent, raise awareness, detect, investigate and prosecute corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is
 &quot;Myanmar more effectively prevents, raises awareness of, detects, investigates and prosecutes corruption&quot;.
The expected outcomes are the following:
Outcome 1: Improved legal and policy environment to support the Governments anticorruption efforts in line with international standards
Outcome 2: Enhanced institutional capacity to prevent, raise awareness of, detect, investigate and prosecute corruption
Outcome 3: Strengthened integrity of the judiciary and prosecution
Outcome 4: Improved capacity of civil society organisations and private sector to
prevent and contribute to combating corruption</narrative>
  </description>
